sequenceDiagram
  participant Runtime as Runtime Service
  participant Chat as Publieke chat/app
  participant Collector as Signal collector
  participant Algorithm as Algorithm Service
  participant ScoreStore as Algorithm scores

  Runtime->>Collector: situation started, situationRunId
  Chat-->>Collector: heart during active situation
  Chat-->>Collector: bored during active situation
  Chat-->>Collector: raw chat messages during active situation
  Note over Collector: Signalen worden gekoppeld aan deze actieve situatie.

  Runtime->>Collector: situation stopped
  Collector->>Algorithm: situationObserved with duration, audience size, hearts, bored, raw chat
  Algorithm->>Algorithm: compute observed score for stopped situation
  Algorithm->>Algorithm: update audience/profile context
  Algorithm->>ScoreStore: publish predicted scores for all situations
  ScoreStore-->>Runtime: current score list
  Note over Runtime: Runtime gebruikt scores binnen eigen order/padregels.
